! ============================================================================
! FOUR-PIPE FAN-COIL HVAC SYSTEM ADDED FOR HONEYCOMB CONTROL STUDY
! EnergyPlus Version: 24.1
!
! Modelling scope:
!   - FCU installed in all seven thermal zones so plant loads are complete.
!   - Proposed control scope remains Zones 1, 2, 4, 5, 6, and 7.
!   - Zone 3 remains a conventional/reference FCU zone.
!   - Existing ZoneVentilation:DesignFlowRate objects are retained.
!     Therefore FCU outdoor-air flow is set to zero to avoid double counting.
!   - Existing detailed zone thermostats and setpoint schedules are retained.
!
! IMPORTANT: HVACTemplate objects must be processed by ExpandObjects.
! Use EnergyPlus with the -x option, then use the generated expanded IDF for
! Python API/EMS actuator development.
! ============================================================================

