  OpenPlan Virtual Air Boundary,            !- Name
  SimpleMixing,                           !- Air Exchange Method
  0.500,                  !- Simple Mixing Air Changes per Hour {1/hr}
  Always On Discrete;                     !- Simple Mixing Schedule Name

